[{"title":"元日雪","author":"周霆震","text":"朔雪遥憎毒雾蒸，两年元日势凭陵。\n气吞鹤表城如玉，声撼龙宫海欲冰。\n不夜与天为汗漫，当春借地示严凝。\n貂裘公子来何暮，好向寒空纵角鹰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20545,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新正雨雪连绵人日大雾近午晴","author":"周霆震","text":"天赐春晴一日恩，乱来骨肉几家存。\n屡危岂望全腰领，积善当知及子孙。\n喜有帆樯通白下，幸无车马到青门。\n往时百万苍生苦，岁晚承平拟细论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20546,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中秋城西感兴","author":"周霆震","text":"玉宇琼楼三万里，乘槎无路匪仙才。\n尘扬海内衣冠尽，雁断云边鼓角哀。\n天意未知何日定，月华空似昔年来。\n故山老桂无消息，红蓼花高满路开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20547,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨困简张梅间","author":"周霆震","text":"湿薪万灶涨烟氛，屋角鸣鸠旦夕闻。\n山接云根如栈道，雨生波晕似犀纹。\n麦苗泥渍连千顷，花信寒消到几分。\n最苦相从巷南北，掩窗十日断论文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20548,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和雨困简张梅间韵","author":"周霆震","text":"天气浑疑挟楚氛，雨淫愁向早春闻。\n红淹小圃违芳信，绿泛回塘乱縠纹。\n远树鸟飞村舍没，淡烟人立野桥分。\n空馀落塈邻翁壁，颠倒蜗涎似篆文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20549,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事","author":"周霆震","text":"横亘东西白气升，喧传入夜事堪惊。\n纵焚倳刃连村市，流血呼冤逼郡城。\n天地岂忘心憯怛，山河未放影分明。\n提携妇女闺房秀，饮涕群驱敢出声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20550,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清和华道士萧宗元","author":"周霆震","text":"月满虚堂奏帝归，仙风吹送紫云衣。\n九还欲致三花聚，一悟能消万劫非。\n老树鹤栖存夜气，清池鱼跃见天机。\n黄冠免得山阴客，未信诗盟与愿违。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日","author":"周霆震","text":"未霜白雁渺关河，来日空随赴海波。\n世难持身高处怯，秋声入耳老来多。\n山中甲子今谁在，日下长安柰远何。\n几度西风馀破帽，悠悠心事唾壶歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和刘子贽韵","author":"周霆震","text":"梦中走马上西凉，回首燕山六月霜。\n尚想筑台思郭隗，谁能荐士效田光。\n三陲吴楚人才劣，百战河山事会长。\n赖有淮南招隐处，掩窗清昼坐焚香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"立秋","author":"周霆震","text":"京洛风尘竟未休，送迎为上敝貂裘。\n萧条人物常如夕，惨澹乾坤又入秋。\n敕使经年遗北海，战场近日在南州。\n纷纷鸡鹜群争入，谁向沧江友白鸥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寇来自北见城中萧然散入村落","author":"周霆震","text":"断雁云低欲度迟，鹊巢何许寄南枝。\n寇兵已厌空城住，官马犹从间道驰。\n万骨白边寒月夜，孤烟青处夕阳时。\n经年北道无消息，望眼频穿泪暗垂。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20555,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"幽愤","author":"周霆震","text":"陇梅驿信杳如缄，白昼连山雾气酣。\n细柳未应仝灞上，蓝田自可转关南。\n惊涛四面轻帆破，疑路千条老骥谙。\n落落怀才宜不少，冥冥当局得无惭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20556,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诏至","author":"周霆震","text":"沈陆如云跬步艰，忽传驿信自燕山。\n九霄日御龙光起，万里春乘海道还。\n忠义铭心扶壮节，老癃垂涕洗愁颜。\n中原黎庶知何似，想望疏恩溥蒯菅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20557,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵刘道原九日","author":"周霆震","text":"旷劫何当洗壒埃，凌高欲藉海为杯。\n巫山雨暗猿相引，汾水云深雁不来。\n新酿偶凭茅舍漉，寒花时向槿篱开。\n仲宣幸有荆州托，未厌吟边数往回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20558,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喜东宫受册","author":"周霆震","text":"海色穿林晓梦圆，战尘氛雾一时湔。\n青宫德进瑶编纪，紫禁恩随玉漏传。\n洛邑车书符永世，汉家日月觐中天。\n秋霜一寸丹心在，稽首洪禧万亿年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20559,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全参政九日宴僚佐城西神冈参谋万德躬赋诗五首用韵寓情 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"画省凝香被羽林，赏心宁许二毛侵。\n闾阎侧听歌谣起，父老争看棨戟临。\n霜露黄花留岁晏，江湖白雁待秋深。\n宴阑归骑营门夕，凉月纷纷落醉襟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20560,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全参政九日宴僚佐城西神冈参谋万德躬赋诗五首用韵寓情 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"能赋登高幕府亲，深秋过雨绝飞尘。\n山城驿路黄柑富，水寨人家白粲新。\n歌舞多非前日境，交游半是异乡人。\n通商近喜官盐集，不比西都巧算缗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全参政九日宴僚佐城西神冈参谋万德躬赋诗五首用韵寓情 其三","author":"周霆震","text":"如云冠盖此高攀，千载龙山季孟间。\n犀箸驼峰传翠釜，银罂春色照苍湾。\n歌姬拥醉翻腔误，才士争先觅句艰。\n秪有相如欣授简，兴来无物不相关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全参政九日宴僚佐城西神冈参谋万德躬赋诗五首用韵寓情 其四","author":"周霆震","text":"兰台无分佩珊珊，断垄平冈自往还。\n避地乱来犹有酒，放怀高处不须山。\n参差红树西风外，明灭青烟落照间。\n何日远寻方外友，却随紫气出函关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全参政九日宴僚佐城西神冈参谋万德躬赋诗五首用韵寓情 其五","author":"周霆震","text":"曾向凌波赋袜尘，绝交近日愧钱神。\n百年抚事皆陈迹，四海知心几故人。\n山借衣冠违世浊，天留萸菊贷秋贫。\n偶寻五柳先生传，自觉年来懒是真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀古","author":"周霆震","text":"关河渺渺几浮沈，落日秋风万古心。\n二顷留人轻六国，一壶玩世重千金。\n乱来耆旧传闻泯，老去英雄悔恨深。\n输与苏门长啸者，不教车马涴山林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠张梅间","author":"周霆震","text":"故人谁似此君贤，涉难交情晚更坚。\n迂路出城寻故友，移床就月话当年。\n霓裳曲奏忘天上，博望槎回记海边。\n归去莼鲈随地有，别来须鬓得秋先。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日遣怀","author":"周霆震","text":"绕篱黄菊自幽香，无复龙山落帽狂。\n身外老来从杂遝，眼前高处倍凄凉。\n妖狐突过荒城雨，旅雁冥飞绝塞霜。\n风物关心倦回首，野园柑熟旋分尝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"还乡初度辱亲友刘卢南惠诗依韵答之","author":"周霆震","text":"憔悴还乡一病翁，雪窗晴透校参同。\n庚寅俛诵湘累语，甲子长怀晋士风。\n尘暗衣冠情索莫，眼青骨肉谊深崇。\n新吟多谢耆年颂，晚节终惭老圃容。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至正十二年壬辰正月武昌失守","author":"周霆震","text":"黄鹤楼前帝子宫，古来形胜控江东。\n运筹要害无豪俊，流祸颠厓总寇戎。\n天马西来勋可树，河冰北渡驿谁通。\n一壶或负千金重，白发丹心愧少同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"述怀二首 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"寇陷吾乡今二日，连宵列炬似星分。\n如何去此三十里，家中消息杳无闻。\n咫尺干戈皆逆境，连绵雨雪助妖氛。\n兀坐此身同槁木，恍然不复辨朝曛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"述怀二首 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"风雪炉存半死灰，每听人语辄惊猜。\n眼穿屡揖亲知问，愁极忽传儿子来。\n足茧荒墟烟惨澹，魂飞间道石崔嵬。\n经过且勿谈辛苦，阖室无虞已幸哉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"默念","author":"周霆震","text":"末路危机逐日新，遭逢瞬息异冤亲。\n多疑忍事甘存拙，久乱全生幸处贫。\n北海牧羝宜反汉，东门牵犬竟亡秦。\n古来反覆无前算，那得匆匆论世人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书所见","author":"周霆震","text":"百金战马厩中屯，部伍酣歌彻晓昏。\n牙帐黑风枭突起，营门白昼虎相吞。\n史徒富躐官曹位，厮养威联士族婚。\n天下纷纷宁有此，我军成败不须论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"记忆先亲复斋先生诗二首 其一 九日初度先父生宋淳祐己酉九月九日","author":"周霆震","text":"厄于阳九画成乾，淳祐遗民自怃然。\n正则庚寅宜有字，绛人甲子已忘年。\n菊枝偶地存幽操，汗简何心理旧编。\n赖有童孙初学语，挽衣争果戏阶前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"记忆先亲复斋先生诗二首 其一 代李季实贺历塘刘所立生日","author":"周霆震","text":"春入霞杯喜拂天，初逾六六纪瑶编。\n人间铜狄何时铸，天上银蟾昨夜圆。\n秋水精神高六月，仙人风骨妙千年。\n山林城市遥相祝，凝望蓬莱隔紫烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"一烬城门火，馀灰已复寒。\n小儿争炙手，犹作燎原看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"杀气频年盛，南昌接武昌。\n帝城春有路，昨夜梦钱塘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其三","author":"周霆震","text":"钱塘江上水，几载独朝宗。\n到海传消息，殷勤起卧龙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其四","author":"周霆震","text":"旌旆簇雕鞍，花袍紫凤团。\n路人潜侧目，敢谓沐猴冠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其五","author":"周霆震","text":"来往动成群，翩翩得意人。\n九朝深雨露，头白独沾巾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其六","author":"周霆震","text":"天骥盐中蹶，瑶钗井底沈。\n如何起阡陌，坐致万黄金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其七","author":"周霆震","text":"银鞍宝校新，罗绮耀青春。\n曾识官仪旧，羞看马上人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其八","author":"周霆震","text":"屏迹谯楼下，深追少壮时。\n卧听更漏鼓，双泪落如丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其九","author":"周霆震","text":"朱衣群百怪，白昼出乘车。\n咫尺青门路，无由得种瓜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其十","author":"周霆震","text":"列位公侯宠，连营使相尊。\n庶僚供指使，谁复耻心存。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其十一","author":"周霆震","text":"徙封馀赤蚁，逐气布青蝇。\n欲市金台骏，黄河又不冰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟复愁十二首 其十二","author":"周霆震","text":"未忍歌鸲鹆，犹能拜杜鹃。\n暮年心寸许，何日睹青天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20587,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赞少陵骑驴","author":"周霆震","text":"巫山云暗失归樵，剑阁春深雪未消。\n泪堕中原天万里，蹇驴独过浣花桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20588,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"戏笔","author":"周霆震","text":"西园蹴鞠醉蒲萄，北里琵琶紫锦绦。\n堪笑东家头白者，一灯深夜读《离骚》。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20589,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客有赋大军来者戏答 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"庞眉炙背短墙隈，问我何时笑口开。\n几度传闻狂欲舞，如今懒说大军来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20590,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客有赋大军来者戏答 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"梦寐渔阳右北平，弯弓走马气凭陵。\n不知近日燕山雪，添得黄河几尺深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20591,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"蕲黄连结蔡州城，风靡江东莫敢膺。\n千里南来今送死，天知忠节在庐陵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20592,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"过江云起剑锋驰，捕取红巾血作池。\n后日庐陵收野史，水东第一赛男儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其三","author":"周霆震","text":"城门书开车马喧，人行呵道竞摩肩。\n军兴那得廷如水，监郡从来不爱钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其四","author":"周霆震","text":"莫道逝川波自平，莫道凫鹥元不惊。\n白发营门二千石，几回霜月送鞭声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其五","author":"周霆震","text":"天岳东回纳赣川，山峰断处是青天。\n螺湖桥下清流水，留向槎滩送战船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"北山口号 其六","author":"周霆震","text":"林郭扬旗激箭锋，江城吹角气如虹。\n义山云雾西昌月，一片丹心两地同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江西省掾陈允中避罪来永新固守城池屹立群盗中泰和宣差以廉明著称境内晏然","author":"周霆震","text":"蜃气楼台转眼空，荒墟谁与吊秋虫。\n道边小屋柴门掩，犹是当年种菜翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"万斛北盐扃海隅，迩来商贩竞南趋。\n去年今日城中价，一贯文才十四铢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"幸及西成早筑场，岁寒犹恐菜畦荒。\n山村肉价何须问，近日鸡豚倍北羊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事 其三","author":"周霆震","text":"烬馀十室九摧残，折取充薪寸寸乾。\n邻境贵收纾乏绝，遗氓窃负活饥寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事 其四","author":"周霆震","text":"鸡豚寥落傍柴荆，粳稻初黄菜甲青。\n卧听儿童传好语，夜来驿使到长亭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪事 其五","author":"周霆震","text":"大洲江水绿如苔，画角吹寒听莫哀。\n白茅冈头黄叶落，鹧鸪洞口鸿雁来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上巳","author":"周霆震","text":"旧俗蚕占拟万霜，儿童犹自赏晴光。\n乱来锦绣无藏处，那有心情到采桑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感古 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"吴宫队长罢论兵，越女西施擅宠荣。\n百鍊一朝成绕指，方知世上有倾城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感古 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"钜鹿诸侯伟战功，咸阳宫殿转头空。\n如何盖世称无敌，也为虞兮泣帐中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"论交","author":"周霆震","text":"古来难觅是知心，旷世襟期感慨深。\n造次陈馀方解印，从容杨震却怀金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"坐看","author":"周霆震","text":"乱后交游隔世心，衰年为客怕登临。\n东风不作年时梦，坐看楼头众绿深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"故人","author":"周霆震","text":"春雨初晴是绿阴，故人隔水晚相寻。\n往来莫信年时路，近日溪流浅处深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20609,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"食性","author":"周霆震","text":"宿舂宁复问精粗，食性年来已尽除。\n随分晚炊诚当肉，且乘新雨理园蔬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20610,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过太平桥","author":"周霆震","text":"秋山戌火夜鸣枭，玉帐春酲富贵骄。\n独抱韦编无寸策，白头羞见太平桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20611,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山家夜雨","author":"周霆震","text":"晚暮携孙此一枝，四年多难秖心知。\n梦回小屋风和雨，却似春滩转柁时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20612,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寇至","author":"周霆震","text":"重叠青山道路长，疏疏红叶树经霜。\n日斜又度横桥去，秖有江声似故乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20613,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城西放歌 其一","author":"周霆震","text":"太平桥外吹血腥，追奔黄?蹶门丁。\n昨日纵横官地上，岂知恶极有天刑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20614,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城西放歌 其二","author":"周霆震","text":"千金堕地不暇顾，妻孥咫尺愁相抛。\n此时争门城内去，悔不云山深结茅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20615,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城西放歌 其三","author":"周霆震","text":"理问军中骑射精，从来赏罚最分明